	(text "DRV8870: brushed motor 6.5-45 V, I_trip = VREF/(10*R_ISEN) = 3.3 V/(10*0.1) = 3.3 A.\nIN1/IN2 PWM from TIM3: forward/reverse/brake. Below 6.5 V (empty 2S) the driver locks out.\nSERVO1-4: S / 5V / GND (use SERVO2 for an ESC; cut the ESC BEC red wire).\nRC1-3 inputs: receiver PWM/PPM, powered from the servo rail, 1k series protection."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
